Document Title: Heracles Software Architecture Description
<<<

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Architecture Overview

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
High Level System Architecture

.. image:: _images/image_000005_a76b0f97d52454316ad15fffbd1ed550133a43ac381d98b61605e53887702cbf.png

Main Modules

The design of the application is based on the MVVM pattern. There are three core components in the MVVM pattern: the model, the view, and the view model. Each serves a distinct purpose. The diagram below shows the relationships between the three components.

.. image:: _images/image_000007_beca19990cf8a5f84597c0c2e38aa8f03cb52503b74d4351e7202156820f627d.png

The MVVN design pattern is implemented in the application as follows: the 4 th  layer is the gRPC wrapper for communication with the Record and Verify services.

.. image:: _images/image_000010_e0c56dab2bc20e969d55cc71cc5355895703eb59b380e31767e98f013a7311e2.png
<<<

